            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "K A T _07"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this soup minus the fish sauce and shrimp since I have a shellfish allergy and I replace the chicken breast with drumsticks since it hold the flavor better in soups to me. Love love love this recipe!",
